  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Enhanced error messages to show actual exception details instead of generic messages. Backend now generates fully encrypted license files using AES encryption (V1 format). Enhanced activation and session logging with detailed HTTP status codes and response bodies for debugging multi-device activation issues. Added automatic file logging to Documents/LicenPro/Logs directory by default for easier debugging. Added synchronous methods (Validate, ValidateOffline, Disconnect) for WinForms/WPF compatibility without cross-thread issues. Fixed WinForms/WPF cross-thread UI access by adding SynchronizationContext marshaling for all SDK events (SessionDisconnected, LicenseExpired, LicenseExpiring, LicenseValidated, LicenseStatusChanged, HeartbeatSent, GracePeriod events). Fixed session visibility in dashboard for licenses not in database by updating queries to include LicenseKey. Fixed session creation on subsequent app launches by adding session connection to ValidateOfflineAsync. Fixed JSON deserialization errors in SessionManager (ConnectAsync, SendHeartbeatAsync, DisconnectAsync) by adding empty content guards and try/catch for JsonException. Fixed disconnect error logging to show meaningful messages instead of empty strings. Fixed access token cleanup in DisconnectAsync exception handler.",
